Package: methylTFRAnnotationHg38
Title: methylTFR Annotations for hg38
Description: Precomputed transcription factor binding sites, motif GC
    frequency tables and a genome-wide GC distribution for use with the
    methylTFR package. Binding sites are genome-wide motif matches
    extended to the footprint window methylTFR reads across; the GC
    tables record how each motif's sites distribute over genome-wide GC
    quintiles, which is what allows a deviation score to be corrected
    for sequence composition. The data are hosted on AnnotationHub and
    retrieved on first use; this package provides the accessors and the
    documentation.
